If you want a slightly more complete pattern with multiple variables:

```wl
Manipulate[
  {a, b, c},
  Dynamic@Column[{
    Control[{a, 0}],
    Control[{ShowMore, {False, True}}],
    Sequence @@ If[ShowMore,
      {Control[{b, 0}], Control[{c, 0}]},
