  Widget["Panel",
    {
      {Widget["Label", {"text" -> "Please provide the following coefficients:"}],
       WidgetLayout -> {"Alignment" -> Center}},
      WidgetSpace[10],
      {Widget["Label", {"text" -> "  Value for p1"}],
       Widget["TextField", {"columns" -> 6}, Name -> "p1_tf"],
       Widget["Label", {"text" -> "            "}]},
      WidgetSpace[10],
      {WidgetFill[],
       Widget["Button",
        {"text" -> "Submit",
         BindEvent["action",
          Script[
            buttonClicked[];
          ]]
        }
       ]}
    }
  ]
];
```

Then define `buttonClicked[]` so it reads the field value:

```mathematica
buttonClicked[] := Module[{p1},
