If you want a dynamic interface where the window moves over the list, use an index `i` and take a slice:

```wl
DynamicModule[{data = Range[20], i = 1, k = 5},
 Column[{
   Slider[Dynamic[i], {1, Length[data] - k + 1, 1}],
   Dynamic[
     window = data[[i ;; i + k - 1]];
     f[window]
   ]
 }]
]
